Name: Chromium Blink Rendering Engine
Short Name: blink
URL: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/main/third_party/blink
Version: 156.0.7103.48
Revision: refs/branch-heads/7103
License: BSD-3-Clause AND LGPL-2.1
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Chromium's web platform rendering engine implementing HTML5 DOM, LayoutNG, CSS Anchor
Positioning, View Transitions Level 2, Speculation Rules Prerender2, Canvas2D, and WebIDL
bindings over V8 and Oilpan GC. Paired in YOLO with `yolo-chromium` (CEF) and Servo Stylo.

Local Modifications:
Managed across `stable` (M156), `dev` (M157), and `canary` (M158) via `yolo cvm`.
